# Build 87. Obj_MovingEsper ($30) at EsperMansionF1's door, 15,27 and
# 17,27 (x $F0/$110, y $1B8), dialogue $88: loc_E05A gives $1687 to a
# standing Rolf and sets $C742; both step eight pixels apart (the one
# spoken to once the talk ends), which opens column 15. On build 85 the
# slot was empty: $1708 and no flag.
start level $11 15 28
wait idle
press up
wait idle
press a
wait idle
expect script $1687
expect flag $C742 1
shot 01_expecting_you
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
wait ticks 30
shot 02_stepped_aside
walk up 3
wait idle
expect level $11 15 25
# Spoken to again from inside, the six Espers before $C743 is 3 give their
# own lines (loc_E730): $8B at 17,19.
walk right 2
wait idle
walk up 5
wait idle
expect level $11 17 20
press up
press a
wait idle
expect script $168B
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect no-stderr level:
